## Pre Made Packages Are a Masterclass in Decision Psychology

Most AV rental websites are a nightmare to navigate. An endless a la carte menu of cables, mixers and projectors forces the customer to become an overnight AV expert just to figure out what they actually need.

We do the opposite. We offer a handful of curated packages named for their purpose: the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) for parties, the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), and the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) for corporate events. That simple strategy removes the burden of choice and replaces it with clear, pre packaged solutions. Instead of asking "which of these 50 items do I need," the customer only has to answer "what kind of event am I hosting."

A real review captures this frictionless approach better than any pitch of ours could. A client admitted she was initially hesitant:

> "Completamente recomendable, Fácil, ágil, rápido... económico. Tenía un poco de miedo usar esta empresa por que era todo muy digital y transparente, y no había histórico, pero... un completo acierto."

In her own words, she was a little afraid to use a company that felt so digital and transparent, with no track record she could see for herself. Her review concludes it was a complete success anyway, easy, agile, fast and affordable. We did not just rent her equipment. The packages themselves guided her from hesitation to a five star review.

